    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not an 'occult invasion' lol. it just felt like a signal. the way they were grouped was so tight, like they didn't even belong in the same aisle level. plus i've been seeing patterns like this in other places too. if you look at the colors and the actual properties of those three things, there has to be some kind of semantic link. like, isn't there a connection between purification and seasonal transition?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
